{"rowNumber":9058,"id":"01姉_02_11h.ks#1393","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I guess I'll suck it up for the time being until the next available opportunity.","korean":"다음 기회까지 참아야겠다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"translated","voice":"","phaseId":"H19-P7"}
